[I] An internationalization library for Perl

[T] libintl-perl is an internationalization library for Perl that aims to be
[T] compatible with the Uniforum message translation system as implemented
[T] in GNU gettext. It is written entirely in Perl, with an optional XS
[T] module, and provides Locale::TextDomain and charset conversion modules.

[U] https://www.cpan.org

